Cyberpunk style: A towering vertical stack of glowing neon-lit horizontal platforms floating in a dark digital void, each platform a different electric color—cyan, magenta, purple, orange—representing interconnected architectural layers. Data streams flow vertically between the layers like luminous rain, connecting them seamlessly. In the background, faded ghostly vertical columns (representing old silos) crumble and dissolve into particles. The scene is viewed from a dramatic low angle, with holographic grid lines extending into the foggy distance. Chrome and glass surfaces reflect the neon glow, creating a sense of technological transformation and modern infrastructure. The atmosphere is moody with volumetric lighting piercing through digital haze.
